2026-11-16T23:06:52.3750923Z === Claude plugin scope migration tests ===
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3756289Z 
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3757155Z   ✓ all six directed scope pairs migrate destination-first with exact verification order
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3758037Z   ✓ a missing marketplace is added at the destination before plugin installation
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3759142Z   ✓ an interrupted source-plus-destination state resumes cleanup without reinstalling
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3760109Z   ✓ resume verifies an enabled destination before removing the source
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3760922Z   ✓ destination-only state is idempotently already migrated, including same-scope input
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3761828Z   ✓ destination-only migration honors explicit hook preferences and reports dry-run writes
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3762646Z   ✓ destination-only state must be enabled before it is considered migrated
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3763453Z   ✓ zero installs, ambiguous non-destination scopes, and invalid inventories fail closed
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3764258Z   ✓ marketplace collisions fail closed in migration dry-run and resume cleanup
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3765072Z   ✓ destination marketplace, install, and verification failures never uninstall the source
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3765848Z   ✓ a concurrent non-destination install aborts before source cleanup
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3766544Z   ✓ source uninstall failure reports both scopes and exact forward recovery
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3767326Z   ✓ final verification failure is structured and leaves a resumable destination state
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3768093Z   ✓ dry-run returns exact ordered actions and performs no mutation
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3768785Z   ✓ migration preserves hook preferences unless --hooks is explicit
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3769450Z   ✓ migration preserves an explicit includeCoAuthoredBy opt-in
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3770559Z   ✓ an explicitly disabled resume destination names the setting and the enable recovery
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3771418Z   ✓ a single-scope explicitly disabled destination is not a generic verification failure
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3772283Z   ✓ a disabled destination without an explicit setting stays generic and gains the enable path
2026-11-16T23:06:52.3773165Z   ✓ a source uninstall that errors but removes the source accepts the verified destination
